#: maggie_mglass/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "MAGNIFYING GLASS"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/4
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh hello again. Come for more Roomers? Looking for more suspects?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I wanted to see if you were interested in taking our relationship further..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am... you got any more for me? I want to find more dateables."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh. I see. I can do that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You and I both. Never know when another suspect will turn up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should I be afraid?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Suspect? Or potential dates?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can guarantee that according to my knowledge there's one hard-boiled criminal in this house..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But with me by your side, there should be no issues at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Why not both?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Here are some Roomers that I have turned up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Johnny Splash - shower. Location: Downstairs bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Winnifred - water heater. Location: Office closet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Lyric Literature - books. Location: Anywhere..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So what do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've met Johnny. Doesn't seem like a criminal."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've met Winnifred, she seems very nice."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lyric? He's not capable of violence I don't think."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - I'm on the case!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/c-2/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hm. But that singing... could be deadly."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/c-3/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But out in that closet... there's very little oversight."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/c-4/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But where do you think mystery novels come from?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-0/42/8/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Glad to have you, gumshoe."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "These should be pretty straightforward to find, though there are some who seem much more difficult."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The shadow knows..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Because he's here."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Met him, he's a dork."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me how I can find him!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What? Incredible!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Word on the beat is that he's hiding in a permanent shadow."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If you can find one around here, I would investigate."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for your help, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I've met all the ones on your list."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're welcome, gumshoe."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-8/15 maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Keep pointing those spectacles at everything you see... and you'll find a whole array of potential suspects at your fingertips."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-8/23 maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or, eyelids, as it were."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-8/31 maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Phoenicia can help you track down plenty of other Roomers if you're looking for more."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But that's just the beginning."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks anyway, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_tutorial_followup/0/g-2/c-9/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not helpful at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug1Fix/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh, hi again!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug1Fix/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Interested in helping me solve my case?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug1Fix/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought we could just chat a bit."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug1Fix/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Tell me about it!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug1Fix/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah. See you around!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hi! I wasn't expecting to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And yet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nevertheless..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, here I am..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Did you change your mind about working with me?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talking to you again was a mistake... Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I want to get back together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. But I'd like to help you solve your last case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I want that, too! But only if you'll help me with my case..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-4/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Let me know if you ever change your mind."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Let's do it! As friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I wish I could explore and investigate the world outside..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But not until this case is finished."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-6/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right... what's this case?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieBug2fix/0/g-0/c-6/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thank you for asking!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/from_stepford_to_scandal/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll meet you at Location One."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/from_stepford_to_scandal/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you there."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/from_stepford_to_scandal/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Which is?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/from_stepford_to_scandal/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Otherwise known as the Dining Room Table."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a distinct air of mystery to the private eye that stands before you—she reminds you of the old detective serials your parents used to watch."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She gives you a scrutinizing glare through her magnifying glass, one eye comically enlarged. It's especially goofy-looking to see it on someone with glasses."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, well, well, what have we here?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/27/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I think I've seen a description for someone wearing just such a fantastic red shirt..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/30
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're not a suspect, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would like to skip this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "A witness, then?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To what, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not that, either."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-0/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so confused already."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-0/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Just as I thought..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I thought so."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Suspected of what?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping you'd tell me..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Being far too sexy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hmph. There's no evidence to support it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-1/26/c-1/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Care to investigate further?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hm, very suspicious behavior... this 'not knowing'."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll leave you with a clue to help you along."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-3/37 maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Take a look at Roomers in your phone - it'll help you find your way to your last dateable for today."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-3/48 maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Good luck, gumshoe."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-3/62 maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-2/22
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's getting late... who should be the last one we talk to before I run out of charges?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/c-3/70 maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-2/30
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Ooh... check out that Roomer Maggie gave you if you need ideas! Wink, wink."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Maggie! It's our human's first day talking with us! Go a little easy on him!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/4/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Maggie! It's our human's first day talking with us! Go a little easy on her!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/5/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Maggie! It's our human's first day talking with us! Go a little easy on them!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Interesting... these glasses come in from the outside and are already trying to influence my case?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Trust me - this human has a lot of potential to make this house a better place."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's true!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do my best, but no guarantees."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't wait to mess every one of you objects up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hmm... Doubt it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/c-4/15 maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Regardless..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hm. Truthful."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hm... we're not under oath... so I'll just have to keep that in my noggin."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As you are the human I should give you a way to track down all the suspects yourself to... keep you on my side, hopefully."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I call this feature: \"Roomers\" - it's installed on your phone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Phoenicia"
msgid "Oooh... that tickles!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/57
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Unlike Skylar's Date-a-dex that gives you the lowdown on those you've already met, Roomers tracks clues you've been given to locate all the pesky hidden objects that are tricky to find..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/65
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's good for rounding up suspects, tracking down evidence, and getting a sense of the household scuttlebutt!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool, can't wait to find all of you!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It'll be tough, but worth it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "The more you find, the better your SPECS will be!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Tough audience, I see..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You'll care one day when an unsuspecting frying pan whacks you in the head and you never saw it coming!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-9/18
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Maggie! Don't make threats like that!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/tutorial_intro/0/g-1/c-9/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sorry, Glasses, I take my job seriously is all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/4
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hello again, suspect."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm hard at work on my current case..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've been hoping for a breakthrough."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sometimes I get so wrapped up that I start seeing everyone through the lens of a mystery!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're a detective, then?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I am! Maggie M. Glassbury at your service!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Perhaps you've heard of me?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've acquired a modest reputation as a result of some of my previous work."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are a couple of your best-known cases?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "More than modest!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie puts her hands on her hips, positively radiating pride."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Why, it was I who solved the mystery of the missing sock!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was you!?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was missing a sock?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "A brief interview with the Stackables and a chat with Dirk was all it took to sort that case out."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/17
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The sock was in the depths of Harper's hamper."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad someone got to the bottom of it!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are you talking about exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Check your Roomers app if you don't know who I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That's what it's there for... in theory, at least."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I also cracked the caper of the self-generating dust rabbits."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds useful..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Where do they all come from?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Very much."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Tracking it down to its source was mighty helpful."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Static electricity."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It causes particles to accumulate around pieces of hair."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Your hair, to be exact. They form undisturbed in dead air pockets."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/24
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That's why they hang out under the couch."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My hair, you say?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's probably my dog's hair."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You and I both know you don't have a dog, dear."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It matched the evidence, and I ruled out every other possibility."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "By the power of deductive reasoning, I determined that you were in fact the culprit."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No getting around you, I see."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/28/g-0/8/g-0/35/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I pride myself on that!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/12/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ah, so you've heard of me!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What mystery are you trying to solve?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Lately I've been taxing my lens to the utmost on a very interesting case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm trying to get to the bottom of a mysterious love letter!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It was delivered to Dorian last night."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me more!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we talk about you instead?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Before that... Does the name \"Martin Applegate\" mean anything to you?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I don't know where you heard that, but I can't talk about it with you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "At least not yet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're scratching the surface of something stranger than you can imagine..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Maybe I'll feel differently later."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "After we've gotten to know one another a little better."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. Let's chat."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/door_mystery/0/g-1/c-4/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Understood. Tell me about the Dorian letter!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/4
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "At approximately 2AM, an unknown suspect dropped off a letter for Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/12
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Upon opening it, Dorian discovered that it carried clear romantic intent!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/20
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That is to say, it was 'asking him out'!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/28
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It described how his protective yet gentle presence had won over the writer's heart."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/36
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If interested, he was to write back as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good so far."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Here's the catch. The letter wasn't signed with a name... just a monogram."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Though he might be hesitant to admit it, Dorian was quite taken by the letter."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "He isn't certain whether he wants to write back until he knows more."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you'd be open to it, I'd love to help."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we chat a little first?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You would?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-0/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Let's get into it!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've never worked with anyone else before..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But I think this could be good for the case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why not start by giving me whatever clues you have?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Description/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you waiting for? Clue me in!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/4 maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What do you want to talk about?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are some of your favorite hobbies?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long have you been a detective?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you single?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now let's talk about that case you're working on."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, when I'm not cracking cases..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I enjoy reading, playing board games, and looking verrrry closely at things."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I enjoy those things, too."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a bit more sporty, myself."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looking closely at things?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Nice to meet someone like-minded."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I always appreciate some movement!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You look like you keep in great shape."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I find that if you investigate thoroughly, even the simplest things can contain wonders!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Take this house, for example."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Did you know that before it was built, there was a firehouse here?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/42
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And before that, a trading post!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/50
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Before that..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/58
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, let's just say there is so much to learn, without even leaving your front door!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How did you find all that out?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm beginning to realize that..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh! There are county records."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And online archives."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And genealogical surveys."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And census data."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/48
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem pretty good at hunting for information."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's keep chatting."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-0/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If only getting to the bottom of my current case was as easy as finding historical building records."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-0/26/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right... Wanna tell me a little about it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-1/16/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's talk clues!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-0/56/c-1/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure you'll find your answers soon enough."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "There are mysteries everywhere!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-0/23/c-2/66/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Such as my current investigation."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As long as I can remember! When I was little, it used to get me in trouble."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I got in trouble a lot as a kid too."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We share that, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I would always dig up lots of interesting facts about my friends in order to share or highlight things I loved about them!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Unfortunately for me, they didn't seem to like it very much."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't blame them."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe they felt their privacy was being infringed upon."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wish someone would do that for me!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I have to say I don't understand. Oh well."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But everything is available online! It's easy to find."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They might not want it that way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't mean someone wants it shared."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Interesting... I'll have to keep that in mind..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll keep that in mind!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie, normally unflappable, seems rather more like a nervous schoolgirl than a stone-cold private eye."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Very!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I mean... normally."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I mean... yes."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I mean yes, I am very normally single."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's nice to know."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm starting to see why."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're making me blush."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe next time we meet, it could be for a date?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "To be honest, I'm not entirely sure if you're my type yet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/c-0/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Let's just stay friends for now."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-2/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How rude!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLetsChat/0/13/8/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ok!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/0/b/5
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The case is pretty thin..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/0/b/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But we've got a couple of clues."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/0/b/21
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "First of all, the paper the note was written on was somewhat interesting."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/0/b/29
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Second, although the letter wasn't signed, it did have a single initial on it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/0/b/37
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Finally, I think Dorian might have a clue for us."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What should we look at next?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's start with the paper. What makes it interesting?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What initial was written on it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's have a chat with Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I know who sent the letter."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "A stylized letter M."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A first initial?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Signature?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Someone started writing and stopped?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Seems likely."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But whose name is simply \"M\" and nothing more?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-1/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've narrowed it down to four suspects:"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Penelope, Mitchell Lynn, Mateo Manta, and Freddy Yeti."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Who do you think it was?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was Penelope, the office supplies."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know Penelope, but I'm SURE it was her."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was Mitchell Linn, food."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know a Mitchell, but it's gotta be him."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was Freddy Yeti, the refrigerator."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Freddy? Don't know him but sounds like a love-letter-writer to me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was Mateo Manta, the blanket!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know who Mateo is but I'm ready to pin blame immediately."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Something doesn't quite add up, there."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-0/18/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Truffles and office supplies don't seem to match. Nor does the \"M\"."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-0/21 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-1/18 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-4/18 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-6/18 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-7/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't think that's right."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-0/29 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-1/26 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-4/26 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-5/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Maybe you can help me on another case, later on down the line."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/15 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Wait a minute... I think you might just be right!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/23 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The stylized letter M is his signature."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/31 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The smell Dorian noticed makes sense now, and the paper..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's gotta be rice paper!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/47/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The smell of truffles came from the gourmand Mitchell Linn!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/50
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You did it! You helped me crack the case!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/61/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The least I could do, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/61/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm impressed!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/61/c-0/15 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/58/c-0/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now I'm even more excited for the next time we meet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-2/61/c-0/23 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/58/c-0/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Let me just go and let Dorian know that his secret admirer has been discovered..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Its gotta be rice paper!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/47
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You did it! You helped me crack the case... without even knowing the suspect at all!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-3/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The least I could do, Maggie. Guessing is my strong suit."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-4/7 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I wish it could be the case... but it doesn't quite add up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-4/15/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Truffles and the fridge might make sense... but not the \"M\"."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-5/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Guessing without enough clues was probably not the best tack."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-6/7 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "This seems like an interesting idea... but the clues don't quite add up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-6/15/b/1 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-7/15/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I just don't see what the truffles have to do with blankets..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-6/26 maggie_mglass/Mystery1Clues/0/c-3/31/c-7/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Perhaps you can help me on another case, later on down the line."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What else should we try with the paper?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/1/b/4
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I have it here... Semi-transparent, and very thin."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/1/b/12
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It doesn't seem like ordinary paper, at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's try cutting it with scissors."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's try burning a small piece."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's taste it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's dip a corner of it in water."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see what other clues we've got."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She gives the paper a careful test snip."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hmmm. Cuts just like normal."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She focuses a magnifying glass on the paper for a few moments, stopping immediately when it begins to smoke and catch fire."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yikes! It's definitely flammable."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Does seem to burn slightly slower than normal paper, though."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Taste it? If you say so..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She carefully dabs a corner of the paper against her tongue."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How interesting! It's edible, and tastes slightly starchy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She dips a corner of the paper into a small glass of water."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ItsRicePaper/0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Look at that! It dissolved!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hey, before I go... I was wondering."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Would you like to have a cup of tea with me sometime?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "...as a date, I mean?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, I would love nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know, I think for now we should just stay friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie lets out a girlish squeal."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Huh. Amazing. Oh. Yes."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "<i>Calm down, Maggie. The human could still be a suspect of any sort!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-0/42 maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/22
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "<i>ahem</i>"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "See you again soon... compatriot in crime."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh... Of course. I understand."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Keeping it professional is my preferred option."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_cup/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hence why I was so... careful to probe the idea of a love relation around you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thanks again for trying to help."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It really was very sweet of you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even though I failed, would you be interested in going on a date some time?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was fun! Let's hang out again some time, as friends!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I could see myself going with someone with poor detective skills like yourself."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/19
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Perhaps we have complementary skills."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/27
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I would be the daring detective... you the... administrative sort."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/35
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The pretty type, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/43/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn straight I'm the pretty type. I'll see you soon."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/43/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/43/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-0/43/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'd fancy that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/mystery1wrapup_divert_nocup/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That sounds divine!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/3
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Hello there, you two."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Good to see you, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/19
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've enlisted our friend here to help solve the case of the mystery letter."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/27
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Splendid idea."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/35
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Can you repeat what you said to me earlier?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/43
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "About the smell you noticed?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/51
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/59
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, when I first opened the letter, I caught the faintest whiff of what I think was... truffle."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/71
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Strange, no?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Indeed. Thanks for your help, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could it have been something else?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Truffle happens to be one of my favorite flavors."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The association between the forest-dwelling fungi and my own wooden provenance bring back fond memories..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Anyhow..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Let me know if you happen to figure out who it was from."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/ChatwithDorian/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm not one for love... but I am one for truffles and friendship."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad to see you again. You look lovely."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I hope you don't mind, I took the trouble of ordering your tea for you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's a jasmine green tea, from Kopi of course."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Before we get into any of that... Does the name \"Martin Applegate\" mean anything to you?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's very thoughtful of you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How did you know my order?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Shhh! We can't discuss that..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/23 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Maybe I'll feel differently after we've gotten to know one another a little better."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/31/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not mysterious or anything..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/31/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems a little 'railroad-y'."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/31/g-0/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sorry. But I can't get into more detail yet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So, how about some tea? I have yours right here."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad you think so."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hope you don't mind I went ahead and researched your favorite order."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How exactly did you do that?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's too sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Simple!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/18 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I just pulled your old MyFace site and sorted through the archive posts until I found one where you listed a few teas you enjoyed."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/26 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Then, I cross-referenced that with photos of you drinking various warm drinks, and did some basic image enhancement on them to determine which exact brand appeared most regularly."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please don't do any more research on me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so considerate."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh... Ok. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-1/26/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I want you to feel cared about."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh wow. That's awesome! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...image enhancement?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/2/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, that's a little over the line."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't like jasmine green tea!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad you approve!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh, nothing fancy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You know, frame averaging, Fourier analysis, de-blur, color channel selection, that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... That's kind of creepy..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel invaded."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Is it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You do!?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/21/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't just go digging through all someone's old stuff like that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/21/c-0/13 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry. I didn't realize it was crossing any lines."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/21/c-0/21 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/21 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-1/21 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll do better in the future."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry. I didn't realize I was crossing any lines."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/29/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry, I didn't realize I was crossing any lines."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/c-2/31/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hmmm... there's alway the tiny chance my research might be faulty, but I still contest that deep inside you it would be your favorite if you gave it a chance."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still, even though you got my order wrong, the thought is appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No matter how you found out about my order, at least the thought is nice."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's fun to be here with you I have to say."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might have made a mistake having a date with a detective like this."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm glad. You know, I've been thinking about you ever since the last time we met."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm glad. You know, I've been thinking about you ever since last time we met."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I rarely let my glass down as it were, so I apologize if I'm a little rusty."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well... we can't be faulted for trying."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've been thinking though..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What have you been thinking?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The way you gave yourself to that last mystery..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Dropped everything in order to help me solve it... Nobody has done that for me before."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd do it again in a heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been thinking about you, too, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That's the most attractive thing you could have said to me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I find everything about you attractive."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You make it really fun."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oof... My heart..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And mine..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's it saying?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie takes your hand in hers, holding it over her chest."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Put your hand just here, below my lens... Do you feel how it's racing?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's beating right out of your chest. What if we...?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we should let it breathe..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Wait. Before we start this... there's something that's been bothering me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I do something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not at all!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I hope you won't laugh... but it's another case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another case? Tell me all about it!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't we finish what we've started, first?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I just can't focus!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I promise, if you help me solve it, I'll devote just as much attention to you as I do to my cases."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now you're talking! Let me hear about it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you can't pay attention to what's in front of you right now, we may not be right for each other."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. If that's how you feel, then we should just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/11/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll be here if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope we can do something else besides solve mysteries together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's just that when a case comes up, I can't seem to focus on anything else until it's solved."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I hope you understand."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do. There are things I'd drop everything for."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems like you might have a bit of an unhealthy obsession with your work."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad you feel that way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As it so happens, I've got another case on my mind right now!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How would you feel about working on it with me?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Maybe afterwards we can do something besides... collecting clues?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm in! Tell me about the case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping we could just enjoy our date."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry. But I am what I am. When mystery calls, I must answer."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll help you, but I don't think we should date anymore."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No hard feelings, but count me out. I'll see you around!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/c-1/15/c-0/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand how you feel. Alright, I'll fill you in and we can work on it as friends!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/42/c-1/15/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. Goodbye for now."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Be that as it may, it's who I am."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If that's a problem for you, I understand, but maybe we shouldn't keep seeing one another."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "At least not... romantically."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that would be best."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you're always solving the next mystery on the horizon, you'll miss out on what's right in front of you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I have worried about that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But the truth is, cracking cases is in my very nature!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Would you want me to change myself in order to fit someone else's ideal?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want you to be happy, and I think your obsession might be getting in the way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only you can decide which sacrifices to make. I respect your choices."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I appreciate what you're saying."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But if I had to pick?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I would choose being alone and working on cases over being coupled and having to leave those stones unturned."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's your choice to make. But I don't think we're right for each other."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm willing to leave our date and help you with this mystery."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. I'll see you around... as a friend."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thank you. I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And with that being said... There's a case I need to get back to."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good luck with it. I think it's best if I just see you around. As a friend."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-0/18/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I suppose I can help you solve another. Tell me about it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh, what about?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think we should keep seeing each other."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like to take this to the next step."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're catching me by surprise, but I understand."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Really? I'd love that too, only..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only what?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Only there's just this one other case that's stuck in my mind."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's hard to focus on anything else. Would you be willing to help me solve it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If so, I promise we can return to this conversation after."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping you might say that! Let's get to work."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate1b/0/g-1/c-7/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, that's a bit of a turn off. Let's just be friends from here on out, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I must say - at this time I've updated your dossier from \"Suspect\" to \"Partner\"."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't know me that well, then."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "No thanks needed - it's simply the truth."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Huh. Perhaps I've made a mistake..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And nevertheless..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You've come at just the right time to help me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've got a case, you see..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do tell!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not really in the mood for a mystery at the moment. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend1b/0/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So, how about this new case I got?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It has recently come to my attention that there is a counterfeit object in the house."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Rumors have been circulating about it for a while."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "At first, I wasn't sure there was anything to them."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/24
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "After all, rumors can be nothing more than loose talk."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But sometimes they are more than just rumors."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Behind a rumor might be a grain of truth..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean Roomers?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I fear so..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Exactly correct."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Entirely different. These are the whisperings of the things around the house. Roomers are clues to help you find all of us here."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The only problem is, the rumors are coming from all over the place, and I can't make heads or tails of where they came from."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you suggest?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, I'd say we could bring in some witnesses!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Capital idea!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get to be good cop!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm. Who have you heard rumors from? Let's talk to them!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We begin."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I should say so!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And I'll be Strictly Professional Cop."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/CaseoftheCounterfeit1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I knew you'd know what to do!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/6
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ok, so I've heard whisperings from Lux, Hoove, and Wallace."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've heard whisperings from Lux, Hoove, and Wallace."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Lux?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Hoove?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Wallace?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right, sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/c-0/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Lux is the conglomeration of lamps and lights in this house."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/c-1/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hoove is the vacuum cleaner located in the laundry closet."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/c-2/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Wallace is the wall."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/c-2/19
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "While he is located everywhere... the best way to get in touch with him would be around the Mayor's Office on the second floor landing by the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Questions/0/15/8/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Who should we talk to first?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about we talk to Lux?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we should talk with Hoove."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/2/s/0 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's ask Wallace what he's heard!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/3/s/0 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's bring in Stepford for questioning! Er... have a chat with him."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/c-0/13 maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/c-1/13 maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/c-2/13 maggie_mglass/suspectchoose/0/c-3/7 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-2/13 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-3/7 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-4/13 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-5/7 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-6/16 maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "All right, when you get in touch, I'll meet you there!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thanks for coming back. The case continues..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Okay, who should we talk to next?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, right. I need to talk to Lux."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I remember, I need to talk to Hoove."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh right, I need to talk with Wallace!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/questions_return/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh of course - Stepford, I forgot!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "After the Scandalabra case, I haven't been able to get you off my mind."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me neither, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm surprised you haven't been occupied with another case!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You mean it?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do. I could see this becoming something really special."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I do. It was a lot of fun and I'd love to... um... do it again."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Especially considering what we did after the case was closed..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As could I."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I actually went ahead and interviewed all your exes and I couldn't find anything worrisome about you at all!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing to find, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You did WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Stare blankly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're kidding, right?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I know! It was barely an investigation!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Just a matter of sorting through old school records and scraping social media profiles."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It was hardly the work of a few long nights."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't do that! That's totally not cool!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean to tell me you spent A FEW LONG NIGHTS going through old records and contacting my exes!?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so romantic!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's not?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "NO! It's totally inappropriate!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's super creepy!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-0/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a major turn off!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I had to know whether you were the real deal!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you see how inappropriate that is, Maggie?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It... is?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we need to have a serious talk about personal privacy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A few times now, you've overstepped some pretty major boundaries. It's starting to make me uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you can't respect my private life, I don't think we can be together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well that's no issue at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can change."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm afraid that's not enough. I need a commitment."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15/g-0/11/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Alright. I <i>will</i> change. For you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm so glad you think so! And for a moment I was afraid you'd be upset with me!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How could I be upset with you? No one has ever cared enough to do something like that for me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I have a feeling we're going to be so happy together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're a naughty one, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've got no idea."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just a little."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I think we're going to have a lot of fun together, you and I."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now that I think about it, something quite... urgent has come up on my end."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "With your breath near me I'm getting rather... fogged up."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/37 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Maybe you can help me deal with it before we carry on our conversation..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/45/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes please!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/45/c-0/10 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/42/c-0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You help Maggie with her urgent case, the details of which we leave to your imagination."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/45/c-0/24 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-0/42/c-0/24
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now that that's taken care of..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Pity. I was hoping for a lot."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Actually, I... have been occupied with something."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another mystery?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You know, I feel like I can finally trust you enough to share something with you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've never told anyone about this before."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can tell me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, there's a case... A case I've never been able to solve..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? You?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you're the best there is!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yes, me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yet there is a way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Which is why it unsettles me so much..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "In spite of everything I've tried, it's escaped me. It haunts me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me. Maybe I can help you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/7/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You already know what it is. It's the mysterious case of Sinclaire the Sink..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/7/b/9
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or should I say... Martin Applegate."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/7/b/17
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Are you sure you're up for this?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/8/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Alright, but... Well... You're going to think this is pretty out there..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/8/b/9
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You sure you're up for this?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm up for it, Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't come all this way with you to back down, now."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, it seems like your life is one big case after the next. I don't think I can keep doing this with you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I knew this would happen eventually."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could we just be friends and end it there?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've given you plenty of chances to choose me over mystery."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You said that next time we saw one another, you would be present with me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Certainly. You've helped me a great deal this far."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. Seems like I just can't change who I am."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Even for you. I guess this is goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieDate2/0/g-2/c-7/11/c-2/18/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You leave Maggie on her shelf. She may be distressed, but there is still a glint of the irrepressible gumshoe within her."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Just who I was hoping to see!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me guess... You've got a new case!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Quite so. And this one will be my magnum opus, I can just feel it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me everything."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me guess. Does this have something to do with someone by the name of \"Martin Applegate?\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ok... here we go."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I see you've already met."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieFriend2/0/c-0/18/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I know there's something fishy going on there, and I'm desperate to get to the bottom of it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF/0/12
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Before we go any farther, I need you to go and have a conversation with someone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF/0/20
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'd like you to speak with the sink, Sinclaire..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF/0/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or should I say, 'Martin Applegate.'"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... What?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Just go and speak with him, and then come back and I'll explain."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/wtf2/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "To the sink... the sink!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/wtf2/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "A great mystery emanates from there. I feel it. I need to know the truth..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It all started with the Dandelion..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The what?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's the first thing I remember, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Up until that point, Sinclaire was his usual self. Just a sink and a bar of soap shaped like a dog. Nothing fancy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But then one day you came home late with some take-out, and after that things started to get a bit weird."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'A bit weird' might be the understatement of the century. But do go on."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I got some take-out from the Questionable Dandelion?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yes, you must not remember. Perhaps it was one of those 'ghost kitchens'."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The ones where they only serve food to ghosts."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/c-1/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Just a detail I remember from the night Sinclaire changed."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "He started insisting that everyone call him by the name Martin Applegate."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And then rumors started going around about all sorts of strange things he was saying."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've heard a few of them myself."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He says some wild stuff, alright."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I must confess, I can't make any sense of it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What I suggest we do is go and speak with him together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that's just the ticket. I know he'd like to speak with you, too."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He mentioned finding someone who was good at solving mysteries."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WTFMartinApplegateWTF2/0/c-0/31/g-0/16/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Excellent. If you'll bring me to him, we can take things from there!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can't believe we actually did it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Solving that case with you was one of the highlights of my existence."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/27
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I barely even know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're great together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We make an amazing team!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No need to say anything! Let's party!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We really are."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-0/18 maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "In fact, I've never felt this way about anyone before."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-0/26 maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You've brought so much fun, so much love into my life..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-0/34 maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-5/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What would you say to making this official?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That we do!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And I'd love to keep solving mysteries with you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As a friend or... as a lover."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Woohoo!!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Break out the mystery dance moves!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And in fact, I've got a gift to give you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie produces a funny little glass, holding it out to you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/48
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's a shot glass themed like a magnifying glass!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/59/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie this is awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/59/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bottoms up!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/c-2/59/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Next stop, hangover city!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now I can finally cut LOOSE!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireSolved/0/g-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "C'mere... friend. Let's get shwasted."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That case will always haunt me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I respect your commitment not to making a rash decision."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just didn't feel right."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't decide when the evidence is so wild!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Like I said... I respect that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It truly was!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But at the same time... I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "For a while, I was starting to find myself very attracted to you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I think that's changed."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you hate me?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not a detective though. You didn't do a good enough job!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'd love for us to remain friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/c-3/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can never see you in the same way."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/c-3/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "After the way that case went..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-0/c-3/23 maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We are over."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm afraid dating is out of the picture for me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireNeverSolved/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I think I need a little time alone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to be with you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just stay friends, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You do?!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do. But I have some reservations."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "In that case..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What should we do with the rest of the day?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a tea date?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/1/s/0 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about we just... um... stay in..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can think of nothing I'd like more."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But I'm not sure I'll be able to think about anything but the gaze of your lovely eyes."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ooh... Maybe we can get a closer look at one another."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/15 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/15 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/15 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/15 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie gives you a heated glance—you're reminded of a beam of sun focused through a magnifying glass."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/23 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/23 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/23 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've been dying to get to the bottom of another mystery:"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/31 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/31 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/31 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/31 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "'The Case of the Missing Clothes,' I think it's called..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/39 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/39 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/39 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/39 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I have a feeling I might be the Prime Suspect."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/50 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/50 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/50 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/50 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She takes you by the hand, leading you away to a place you can be truly alone together."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/58 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/24/c-0/58 maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-1/58 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-1/58 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-1/58
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie is by far the most satisfying mystery you've solved—by the end of the night you can say this is one case you've busted wide open."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Of course! I understand."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm... not for everyone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But a friendship with you is sure to be full of joy!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Come back and see me any time you like."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieLover/0/c-1/39 maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-2/42
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I will forever cherish the memories of our adventures!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have some reservations..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would love that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Maggie. I think we should just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I truly can't wait to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I promise I'll be the best partner to you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You've already given me the confidence to know that you'll be the best for me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How should we start our new relationship off?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about we finish that tea date?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-1/50/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And this time I promise not to get distracted."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "No need to apologize."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm disappointed, of course, but..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If I've lost a lover, I've gained a great companion!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MakeItOffical/0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Come back and see me any time."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What are they? Maybe I can help you get past them."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have trouble respecting privacy."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have trouble staying present."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I know... It's a real problem."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But you've helped me see things differently."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Instead of always looking for the next case..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can now see that what I really want is right in front of me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/47 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/18 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Should we go out for a cup of tea?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/0/s/0 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, Maggie. I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish I could say I was convinced."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/26/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And I promise I won't get sidetracked!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. Sometimes I do tend to speak plainly."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieReservations/0/c-1/55/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Regardless... I look forward to a long friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/0 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well... I guess you have mentioned it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/8 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll do better."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/16 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're worth it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/27/s/0 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok Maggie. I feel comfortable dating now."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/28/s/0 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know Maggie. I'm not convinced."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You've made me so happy I can barely think straight."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand. Perhaps my apology wasn't as flowery compared to the others..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-1/15 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I speak plainly - it's who I am."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-1/23 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And I can plainly say... that we will make good friends. And I won't go snooping around in your affairs."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/PromisetoImprove/0/c-1/31 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-2/34/c-1/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're worth my trust."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "This is the first I'm hearing about it."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Looking up stuff is part of who I am!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I need you not to treat me like a case."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess it's not that big a deal."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've told you about this."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm not sure if I can change just like that."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I wish you'd said something before."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You'll have to take me as I am."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or just be friends with me."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll take you as you are, then."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I look forward to a long friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-1/7 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Yippee!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-1/18 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Because I just found your favorite store for treats!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-1/26 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Based on that GPS tracker I installed on your phone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-0/39/c-1/34 maggie_mglass/WhatAreYouTalkingAbout/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're gonna love what I got you!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can't believe what happened back there..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know. That was really rough."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I feel like I let us down."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He'll be alright."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Really rough."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It was... both of us."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Will he?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can't help but feeling he's been permanently damaged."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What happened with Sinclaire will haunt me forever."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "My whole identity as a detective has been shattered."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't say that!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about us?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It'll get better in time."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Why not? It's the truth."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I failed one of our own in his time of need."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You know what? I don't know if it ever will."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry to say this, but..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-1/8/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Please don't come see me anymore."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieSinclaireFailed/0/g-1/8/11 maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_hate_joiner/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Case closed!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie clutches at her head, wincing."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/12
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Owwww my lens..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My head..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ugh... I'm still hung over from our party."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But I don't regret a thing."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Unless... there's something I'm forgetting?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You made out with a dust bunny..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got naked and ran through the living room..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We... Um..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I don't regret that at all."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Lint Eastwood is ravishing."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Did I?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, lucky living room!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Let's just say it was a one-time thing, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Woof... I'm speechless."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're a good team, Maggie. As detectives and lovers..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have to say anything."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're right... I'm so used to being in the drivers' seat."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/MaggieHungOver/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But we make a great pair."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hey! So glad to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm always thinking of our adventures."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hope some day we get to do it again."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/24/s/0 maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Any new mysteries?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/25/s/0 maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We had a lot of fun, didn't we!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/27/s/0 maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/18/s/0 maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/c-0/7 maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not right now, but you'll be the first one I'll call!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll call you if any new cases come up!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Absolutely. I'll let you know if any new capers arise!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm happy to see you again, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm still on the search for a new case..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_candy_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll let you know if any new cases come up!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry but I'm not taking any new cases."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess, goodbye?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you didn't polish your glass... (USE SMARTS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You polish your glass after a good night's sleep."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So?!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That means you haven't been sleeping! By deductive reasoning I know you NEED another case!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Damn you! Alright... You're RIGHT. I've been up for DAYS trying to find one!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me be your friend, Maggie. I'll point you towards a new caper."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I suppose with new evidence, even the \"guilty\" can be proved innocent."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hello, gorgeous!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What should we do today?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Care for a bit of close reading?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/24
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or a spot of tea?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/32
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Or should we just inspect the sheets for a while?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tea for two."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Reading sounds nice!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see what we can detect in the bedroom..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "My favorite!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Off we go!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You sip and savor together, reminiscing in your cases past."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "There's a new mystery novel I can't put down."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You devour mystery after mystery, though Maggie does tend to spoil the ending within the first few pages."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I've got evidence of some naughty thoughts..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We're a match made in heaven, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/Maggie_love_return/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The case - The Mystery of the Lustful Lover. The culprit - you. The verdict - Guilty."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So I can pick up human cases? I've always been curious about how those work."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I think I'll need a name change though..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How about Nancy Drue?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that's taken..."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll have to brainstorm then."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Do you have the necessary evidence though?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's all in the case file."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm still investigating."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_join/0/g-0/c-2/10
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Always best to investigate before making a decision."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You're back? Is the case closed?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Open and shut."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Open... but not yet shut."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Then I will remain here until you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Can Maggie solve the mystery if we can bring a dateable object to life?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "C'mon Maggie, let's solve this Realization Riddle!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a magnifying glass, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Do you have manilla envelopes?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, you're a human!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I am aware. I have deduced this by the simple fact of taking a breath."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Splendid."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I would like to start making a case file immediately."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For who?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Everyone."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie began her investigative career - vowing to catch criminals with ironclad evidence."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "However, after her 15th crooked Wall Street banker walked free with only six months in prison and a 6 year trial, Maggie found there was an insurmountable gulf between guilt and justice."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/37
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Damn them."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "After only a brief period of despondence, Maggie realized she could create her own justice - in the form of stories."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She turned the great looking-glass of her intellect towards the creation of a new genre of fiction - Magnified Detective Romance."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-0/c-2/61
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "My stories involve a very close look at the intricacies of investigative lovemaking."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_realized/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... can you give me an example of this style of romance?"
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well... I wrote my first one about you."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/14
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You showed me how possible investigative lovemaking is."
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/30
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"The magnifying glass shivered with ecstatic anticipation as the warm hand clasped firmly around her.\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/38
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"'Is this your first case?' her lover asked.\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/46
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"'...y-yes,' she breathed.\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/54/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"'Don't worry,' her lover said, 'just focus on the hard evidence.'\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/57/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"'Don't worry,' her lover said, 'let Lady Justice take care of everything.'\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/60/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"'Don't worry,' her lover said, 'I'll take the closest look, and not miss a single detail.'\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/63
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "\"Convex to concave, their beings touched on all the facts of the case, leaving no stone uncaressed.\""
msgstr ""

#: maggie_mglass/maggie_love_divert/0/79
msgctxt "Maggie"
